# Normalise to LF in the repository. Windows checkouts get LF too, not CRLF.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: a .husky hook checked out with CRLF fails
# with `sh: ^M: not found`, and the pre-commit gate stops working silently.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
